# ENV REGISTER: a verdict for every setting the Flash Next serve reads, from the engine's own table.
# One line per setting that dev.env does not export: default-ok (with its measurement),
# debt (explicit and counted, to be measured) or unreachable (with the reason).
# check-env-coverage.py fails on any setting with no line and on any line with no setting.


# Added by update-env-register.py against 32fbea1cb.
# debt TF_STARTUP_RECEIPT: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (opt-in startup and first completion receipts); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_SHARED_PRICE_LOG: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (1 logs the shared plain price, a line a round); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_DEVICE_CHECK: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (0 skips serve's device-profile check; default 1); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_MAX_PDF_PAGES: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a whole number from 1 to 4294967295 (capped by --vision-max-images); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_TOOL_ID_KEY_FILE: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a path without control characters to a file only its owner can read, holding at least 32 key bytes; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_CUDA_KERNELS: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a captured kernel set's folder without control characters, or native for the engine's own kernels; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_NCCL_LIB: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms an NCCL library path without control characters, or blank for libnccl.so.2; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_CARVEOUT: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_CARVEOUT_MIB: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a positive whole MiB count fitting a native byte size, or empty for 1792 MiB; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_DRAFTS: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a whole number from 0 to 4294967295 (clamped to the drafter's window); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_DRAFT_NODES: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a whole nonnegative native-size node count (capped by the drafter's window); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QMMF_HALF_BELOW: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a whole nonnegative native-size block count (0 disables half tiles); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_HY4_MEM_FLOOR_GIB: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms whole GiB of MemAvailable below which the Hy4-flash CUDA loader stops (default 10); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_HIP_MEMORY_LIMIT_GB: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a finite GiB amount (the HIP admission still fits its byte count in a 64-bit size); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QWEN_KEEP_LATE: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_COST_KEY_TRACE: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_TIMING: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_NO_TREES: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0; 1 keeps the CUDA drafter's chains only); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_TREES: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0; opt in to sampled MTP tree drafting); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_BATCH: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 1; 0 keeps one stream at a time); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QWEN_POOL_LOG: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_Q27_POCKET_OFF: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms all, or a list of layer:neuron pairs without control characters (default off); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PROMPT_CACHE_KEEP_OTHERS: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_PROMPT_INTERMEDIATE: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
