# debt TENSORFOLD_UNIFIED_HOST_COUNTS: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms 0 or 1 (an integrated GPU on Linux: 1 counts /proc/meminfo, 0 the CUDA pool); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_ROCE_GID_INDEX: new in the table at 32fbea1cb, not measured on our stack; forms a whole GID index from 0 to 2147483647; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
